IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `ppl-parent`

-- Paid Parental Leave Act 2010 (Cth), ss 11D, 13, 21, 31A, 31AA, 31AB, 31ABA, 32-37, 39, 41, 45, 46, 54, 57A, 59A, 60, 65, 67-74, 99, 101, 115B, 115C; PPL rules ss 7B, 9, 21-24B, 36 -- worked cases.
--
-- Every assertion is a claim about the ENCODING on stated facts, not about the law. Nothing here has been checked
-- against a decided case. The Paid Parental Leave Rules 2021 are deposited and used.
--
-- Fixtures are generated from a table of which flags are set (scratchpad gen_paid-parental-leave-act-2010_baseline.py). Expected results were written by
-- hand from the text.

-- Scenario facts: Oliver born 5 September 2030, Chloe at Ironbark since 5 February 2024 (c061), Liam's four weeks from the birth
-- (c063); Ella born 12 April 2033 (c071); Chloe joins Jarrah on 1 February 2034 (d04c); Luca born 2 February 2030 to Priya, a
-- permanent resident from 2027 and a citizen from July 2030 (d040); Ruby born 22 January 2033 to Tahlia and Jake, unmarried, Jake a
-- sole trader with an ABN (k052, k053). Hours worked, months with Liam's employer, the income limits after indexation, the hourly
-- national minimum wage and the charge percentage are ASSUMED or HYPOTHETICAL and labelled where used.

